[PrintTextModified Text:虽然这里确实到处都是灰尘，<br>可大家也不至于有心情打扫吧。|#0101Adv29_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这里没有其他令人在意的事了）|#0101Adv29_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了躲避看守的视线，<br>艾玛她们慌忙离开了玄关大厅。|#0101Adv29_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

